{"seq":3,"slug":"safety-gates","title":"第 3 章：发布安全与门禁","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/safety-gates","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"release-gates-quality-signals","title":"发布门禁与质量信号设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/safety-gates/release-gates-quality-signals","wordCount":1818,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"rollback-rollforward-decisions","title":"回滚与前滚决策框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/safety-gates/rollback-rollforward-decisions","wordCount":1918,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"release-incident-response","title":"发布事故响应与复盘机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/safety-gates/release-incident-response","wordCount":1898,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"第-3-章-发布安全与门禁\">第 3 章：发布安全与门禁</h1><p>发布流水线的速度再快，如果缺少可靠的安全机制，每次上线都是一场赌博。本章覆盖发布过程中的三道防线：事前的质量门禁（在问题到达用户前拦截）、事中的回滚/前滚决策（问题发生时的最优响应）、以及事后的发布事故响应（将事故转化为系统改进）。</p>\n<p>三篇文档构成一个完整的风险闭环——从预防、到处置、到复盘改进，每个环节都有明确的操作规程和判定标准。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"release-gates-quality-signals\">发布门禁与质量信号</a></td>\n<td>门禁分类、信号选择、自动化判定、误报治理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"rollback-rollforward-decisions\">回滚与前滚决策</a></td>\n<td>决策框架、触发条件、数据兼容性、操作规程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"release-incident-response\">发布事故响应</a></td>\n<td>响应流程、时间线管理、根因分析、改进闭环</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n"}